# Heavy artifacts are excluded by PATH, never by extension.
#
# This is deliberate and worth stating, because the obvious shortcut breaks the
# repository. Ignoring `*.npz`, `*.pdf`, `*.json` or `**/results/` globally
# silently swallows exactly the files a reader needs: the tracked result tables
# under `results/`, the exported figure inputs (`results/*/figure_inputs.npz`),
# and the published figures under `figures/`. Add extension globs here only after
# checking them against `git check-ignore -v` on a path in `results/` and one in
# `figures/`.

# ── Regenerated pipeline output ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Written by the experiment scripts, read by the figure scripts when present
# (see src/mnpe_paper/figure_io.py). Gigabytes when a full pipeline is rerun,
# and never required to rebuild a figure.
/artifacts/

# Pipeline artifacts, trained estimators and tuning databases, wherever a script
# still writes them beside itself.
experiments/**/*.pkl
experiments/**/*.pt
experiments/**/*.db
experiments/**/*.npy

# Resumable-run scratch: per-unit checkpoints that scripts merge into the
# tracked result table, plus smoke-run output. Both are intermediates.
**/*_parts/
**/*_SMOKE*

# Sampled posteriors and per-run sweep rows, regenerable and large. Both normally
# land under /artifacts/ above -- the scaling sweeps resolve a relative --row-dir
# or --posterior-dir there deliberately. These two rules are the backstop for a
# script that still writes such a directory beside itself.
**/posteriors*/
**/rows_*/

# The figure scripts write a PNG beside every PDF. The paper uses the PDFs; the
# PNGs are a convenience roughly three times their size, so they are regenerated
# rather than tracked. Note this is a path rule, not `*.png` -- see the warning at
# the top of this file.
figures/*.png

# Logs
**/logs/
**/sbi-logs/
*.log

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/

# ── Tooling caches ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
